{"id":"de5d3e9530a68ea0","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-non-isolated-types.md","title":"Non-Isolated Types","display":"df-non-isolated-types — Non-Isolated Types","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-non-isolated-types","aliases":["17-df-non-isolated-types"],"display":"df-non-isolated-types — Non-Isolated Types","depends_on":["[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-type]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_section":"2.2","source_result":"Local-realization convention; local Stone-isolation reformulation for complete types","source_pages_print":[79,80],"source_pages_djvu":[95,96],"source_verification":"source local-realization definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; Stone-isolation correspondence derived locally; no matching source terminology claimed","source_verification_history":["not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-non-isolated-types"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-non-isolated-types</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-non-isolated-types — Non-Isolated Types"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Local-realization convention; local Stone-isolation reformulation for complete types"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>79</span><span>80</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>95</span><span>96</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"source local-realization definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; Stone-isolation correspondence derived locally; no matching source terminology claimed"},{"key":"source_verification_history","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\)</span> 与完整型空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n(T)\">\\(S_n(T)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是候选公式集。以下定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Isolated}_T(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{Isolated}_T(p)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T(p)\\)</span> 同时适用于全部有限元数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 在定义式内局部绑定，不是调用处隐藏的自由参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Isolated}_T(p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(p\\in S_n(T)\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in p\\;\\forall q\\in S_n(T)\\;\n(\\varphi\\in q\\leftrightarrow q=p)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T(p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\bigl(\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;p\\in S_n(T)\\bigr)\n\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Isolated}_T(p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Isolated}_T(p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(p\\in S_n(T)\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in p\\;\\forall q\\in S_n(T)\\;\n(\\varphi\\in q\\leftrightarrow q=p)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T(p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\bigl(\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;p\\in S_n(T)\\bigr)\n\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Isolated}_T(p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in S_n(T)\">\\(p\\in S_n(T)\\)</span>，第一式就是 Stone 基本开集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{q\\in S_n(T):\\varphi\\in q\\}\">\\(\\{q\\in S_n(T):\\varphi\\in q\\}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{p\\}\">\\(\\{p\\}\\)</span>；这里把集合展开，因此元数可以在谓词内部绑定。原书 §2.2 pp.79–80 使用“局部实现”而不是这里的 Stone 名称。两种表述的局部等价证明：若满足公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的每个实现完整型均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 蕴涵 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 中每个公式；反之亦然。若某个与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致的公式蕴涵完整型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，则该公式本身必在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 中，否则完整性给出其否定，矛盾。因此非孤立性恰与完整型的局部省略对应。此处等价性是本地推导，不宣称原书使用了“isolated”这一术语。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 与完整型空间 $S_n(T)$ 取 [[17-df-type]]。$p$ 是候选公式集。以下定义的 $\\operatorname{Isolated}_T(p)$ 和 $\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T(p)$ 同时适用于全部有限元数；$n$ 在定义式内局部绑定，不是调用处隐藏的自由参数。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 与完整型空间 $S_n(T)$ 取 [[17-df-type]]。$p$ 是候选公式集。以下定义的 $\\operatorname{Isolated}_T(p)$ 和 $\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T(p)$ 同时适用于全部有限元数；$n$ 在定义式内局部绑定，不是调用处隐藏的自由参数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"S_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Isolated}_T(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T(p)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Isolated}_T(p)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(p\\in S_n(T)\\land\n\\exists\\varphi\\in p\\;\\forall q\\in S_n(T)\\;\n(\\varphi\\in q\\leftrightarrow q=p)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T(p)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\bigl(\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;p\\in S_n(T)\\bigr)\n\\land\\neg\\operatorname{Isolated}_T(p).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p\\in S_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{q\\in S_n(T):\\varphi\\in q\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{p\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":2234,"backlinks":[{"id":"b0923b75f2632493","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"若 $T$ 不一致，局部实现恒假而局部省略恒真；因此存在省略模型的定理必须另列 $T$ 一致。理论无需完备，公式集也无需是完整型。对完整型，局部实现与 Stone 孤立性相同，见 [[17-df-non-isolated-types]] 的局部推导。"},{"id":"7a9661711dbc540e","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$|L|$ 与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]；$S_n(T)$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。$m:\\omega\\to\\omega$，$(p_n)_{n\\in\\omega}$ 为公式集序列。$\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}$ 见 [[17-df-type-realization]]，$\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T$ 见 [[17-df-non-isolated-types]]；两接口均在内部绑定有限元数。一般公式集的实现及局部省略见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]、[[17-df-local-omission]]，证明使用 [[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]。"},{"id":"979cffef60954613","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T$ (non-isolated type predicate, see [[17-df-non-isolated-types]])"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-non-isolated-types]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union